```{=html}
<div class="list research-cards-grid">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<article class="research-card" id="<%- item.id %>" data-interest-id="<%- item.id %>">
<a class="research-card-link" href="<%- item.href %>">
<div class="research-card-graphic">
<%= item.graphic_svg %>
</div>
<h2 class="research-card-title"><%- item.title %></h2>
</a>
</article>
<% } %>
</div>
```
